  "notes": [
    "SOURCE QUALITY: every page of this PDF is a 975x637-pixel JPEG (75 dpi) of a full landscape sheet (page 8 is 637x975). On the Form 14a item pages (pages 1-7, roughly 150 items) the codes, project names and peso amounts are too blurred to read digit by digit even when zoomed, so the item table was NOT transcribed. Only the Form 14b summary by office (page 8, larger type) was transcribed, as table summaryByOffice.",
